WEBVTT

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:30.090
The color blue soothes the soul.

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:33.532
It washes away your worries and stress.

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:39.197
Blue awakens the true, innocent heart.

