00:17:53.138 --> 00:17:55.266
Nao, I brought you some watermelon slices.

00:17:57.309 --> 00:17:58.003
Nao?

00:18:02.915 --> 00:18:04.007
Did you find any?

00:18:05.117 --> 00:18:06.380
Nope.

00:18:06.485 --> 00:18:07.543
None here.

00:18:07.986 --> 00:18:08.919
Same here.

00:18:12.124 --> 00:18:13.683
Everyone, come here!

00:18:19.731 --> 00:18:20.664
Found them...

00:18:21.967 --> 00:18:23.492
They're sea fireflies.

00:18:26.572 --> 00:18:28.836
They're so pretty, big brother!

00:18:29.508 --> 00:18:30.304
Aren't they?

00:18:30.709 --> 00:18:33.804
But don't tell dad we came here!

00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:37.549
Okay! I promise I'll keep it a secret!

00:18:38.817 --> 00:18:39.648
Pinky swear!

00:18:40.052 --> 00:18:40.610
Okay!

00:18:49.528 --> 00:18:50.620
What's that?

00:19:00.772 --> 00:19:01.898
Big brother!

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:07.203
I'm sorry.

00:19:07.446 --> 00:19:08.845
What's the meaning of this?

00:19:09.214 --> 00:19:11.192
Did they coerce you into this?

00:19:11.216 --> 00:19:14.914
No, I'm the one who asked everyone to come.

00:19:15.387 --> 00:19:16.218
You?

00:19:17.122 --> 00:19:18.556
| wanted to show them...

00:19:25.497 --> 00:19:26.589
This is...

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:33.167
Sea fireflies...

00:19:38.443 --> 00:19:41.071
| wanted to show them this...

00:19:42.481 --> 00:19:44.279
To my friends...

00:19:45.083 --> 00:19:47.450
But why didn't you tell me?

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.648
Nao made that!

00:19:50.789 --> 00:19:52.382
For you.

00:19:57.029 --> 00:19:57.757
Nao...

00:20:00.832 --> 00:20:01.993
It's pretty.

00:20:02.401 --> 00:20:03.232
Yeah...

00:20:05.771 --> 00:20:06.738
Thanks.

00:20:14.413 --> 00:20:18.543
The color blue soothes the soul.

00:20:19.351 --> 00:20:21.649
It washes away your worries and stress.

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:26.249
Blue awakens the true, innocent heart.

00:20:28.427 --> 00:20:32.159
Let's wrap it up with a huge firework bang!

00:20:50.449 --> 00:20:54.818
<i>Summer is the season when
the color blue thrives...</i>

00:21:07.866 --> 00:21:10.745
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:21:10.769 --> 00:21:16.435
we're just happy when we're together
issho nara ureshiku nattari

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:25.109
Somehow we connect, everyone together
Nanto naku tsuuji au minna ga ii ne

00:21:33.458 --> 00:21:38.706
We lay down on the riverbed
Kawara no shamen nekoron da

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.700
stretching our arms and legs
teashi wo nobashite

00:21:42.768 --> 00:21:50.607
Birds flew above our heads
Atama no ue wo tori tachi ga tobitatta

00:21:52.077 --> 00:21:56.758
I just look up at the sky
Futo miageta kyou no sora

00:21:56.782 --> 00:21:59.774
it seems to spread forever
doko mademo hirogaru

00:22:00.285 --> 00:22:05.466
All the things bothering me
Donna yuutsu na koto demo

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:10.291
<i>seem so small
chiisaku omoeru yo</i>

00:22:13.065 --> 00:22:15.943
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:22:15.967 --> 00:22:21.963
we just sing our favorite songs
suki na uta kuchi zusande tari

00:22:22.307 --> 00:22:30.307
That's the best, that's when it feels great
Sonna toki ga ichiban kimochi ga ii ne

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:41.015
To Chiharu Nitta

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:52.936
Kyoichi

00:22:56.675 --> 00:22:57.972
It's so blue...

00:23:01.012 --> 00:23:02.824
Next Episode

00:23:02.848 --> 00:23:03.758
Next Episode White ball, the
yearning, the National Championships...

00:23:03.782 --> 00:23:05.409
White ball, the yearning, the
National Championships...

00:23:05.717 --> 00:23:08.345
Damn it! To hell with the ocean!

00:23:08.754 --> 00:23:11.519
In that case, I'm putting all
my energy into baseball!

00:23:11.823 --> 00:23:13.484
Bring me the whip and candles!

00:23:13.558 --> 00:23:14.035
I Want To Give You Blue Skies

00:23:14.059 --> 00:23:15.737
I Want To Give You Blue Skies
Next episode of Boys Be...

00:23:15.761 --> 00:23:17.038
I Want To Give You Blue Skies
| Want To Give You Blue Skies.

00:23:17.062 --> 00:23:17.505
I Want To Give You Blue Skies

00:23:17.529 --> 00:23:17.972
I Want To Give You Blue Skies
Watch out, Horikawa!

00:23:17.996 --> 00:23:19.122
Watch out, Horikawa!

00:23:19.564 --> 00:23:20.326
Victory!
